# Varadic Hegemony

id:polity-varadic-hegemony a oa:Polity ;
    skos:prefLabel "Varadic Hegemony" ;
    oa:ambiguousName false ;
    oa:color "#BA68C8" ;
    oa:editorialNote "\"Expansionist Late Consolidation and early Integration vec-dominated polity\nwhich broke off from the Arantan Empire\", dissolved by Dominion governors\nwithin three centuries of the Cygnus Wars. No year stated." ;
